{
  "title": "Old Fashioned Jamaican Cabbage Stew",
  "description": "A salty, dense, and nostalgic Jamaican dish featuring savoy cabbage, this stew is a classic comfort food. It is shojin-friendly and made with katsuramuki-cut cabbage.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
